# Chapter 8: back to Vividos, the Key of the Scion, Lothian's burial, the
# pilgrimage to the birthplace of Moriens.
do: bypass:7839,24831,56,6 back from Lithos to the cemetery (in the game through the field with the stone symbol)
do: reach:Vividos;talk:Vividos;say:I have met the Mountain King.;sayall
expect: Vividos gave me the Key of the Scion
# Lothian's body lies outside behind the mausoleum once Lithos has been
# spoken to; the Key of the Scion on it buries her. Not found yet in the
# playthrough (perhaps the way back over the stone symbol lays it there)
do: assume:lothInterred=1 Lothian buried with the Key of the Scion (her body outside behind the mausoleum not found)
do: talk:Vividos;say:I have interred Lothian;sayall
do: journal:text
expect: Vividos has named me his Scion
